# Test env vars (F015). Loaded automatically by Vite/Vitest for `npm run test` (mode "test").
# Relative, same-origin path (mirrors .env.production) rather than an absolute dev host/port: MSW's
# Node setupServer resolves relative handler paths (e.g. '/api/categories') against jsdom's default
# same-origin location, so keeping this relative avoids an origin mismatch between the axios
# baseURL and the MSW handler patterns in src/mocks/handlers/*.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
